  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In-kind donation of humanitarian aid to Ukraine 2022 UA (Transcarpathian Regional Clinical Hospital of Andrej Novak)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Materi&#xE1;lna humanit&#xE1;rna pomoc Ukrajina 2022 - Transcarpathian Regional Clinical Hospital of Andrej Novak</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Ministerstvo vn&#xFA;tra Slovenskej republiky a Spr&#xE1;va &#x161;t&#xE1;tnych hmotn&#xFD;ch rezerv poskytli humanit&#xE1;rny materi&#xE1;l&#xA0;Ukrajine. &#xDA;stredie ekumenickej pastora&#x10D;nej slu&#x17E;by v OS a OZ SR poskytlo lek&#xE1;rni&#x10D;ky a obv&#xE4;zov&#xFD; materi&#xE1;l Ukrajine.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Ministry of Interior of the Slovak Republic and Headquarters of ecumenical pastoral service in the Armed Forces and Armed Corps of the Slovak Republic have provided in-kind donation of humanitarian aid to Ukraine in 2022 - first aid kits, bandages.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
